error[E0182]: after() on 'Person' orders by 'email', which is neither @id nor @unique
  --> check_orm_repo_after_not_unique.bit:17:39
   |
17 |   db.table<Person>().orderBy("email").after(Value.Int(1)).limit(20)
   |                                       ^^^^^ the page boundary would be ambiguous, silently skipping or repeating rows — order by a unique column instead
